{
  "rationale": "Use a small event-generator plant and a deterministic policy specification with one-shot action states. The specification enforces safe obstacle recovery under open-loop motion pulses, keeps all uncontrollable events defined at every state, avoids enabling forward/random motion in obstacle states, and returns quickly to exploration after path_clear.",
  "strategy": [
    "Model sensing and actuation availability as simple plants over the given event set only",
    "Encode the exploration/recovery policy in one deterministic specification with exactly one controllable action per nonterminal policy state"
  ],
